---

*Poseidon AmphibWorks is developing the Trident LS-1, the first in the planned product line, an all-electric (hybrid option), highway-legal amphibious vehicle with active hydrofoils, spun off from Steve Tice's engineering firm QuantumWorks. Learn more at [pre-seed.poseidonamphibworks.com](https://pre-seed.poseidonamphibworks.com).*

*Built in San Diego is a free feature series by Revvia that tells the stories of the real people behind San Diego's local businesses - the founders, the operators, and the builders who make this community worth living in. Every feature includes a professionally written article, a live backlink, and an owner's story told the way it deserves to be told.*
